"Airbag adds a small hook to each agent's own settings file. It runs before every shell command, takes a snapshot and stops only what a snapshot cannot undo. Other hooks in those files are left untouched; a backup is kept." = "Airbag 会在每个智能体自己的设置文件中添加一个小钩子。它在每条 shell 命令执行前运行，创建快照，并且只拦截快照无法撤销的操作。这些文件中的其他钩子保持不变，并会保留备份。";
